    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-indent:-24.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\">Acemoglu, Daron, and James A. Robinson著，2013，《國家為什麼會失敗》。台北：衛城。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-indent:-24.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\">Legates, David R., Anthony R. Lupo, S. Fred Singer, 2021, <em>Hot Talk, Cold Science: Global Warming&rsquo;s Unfinished Debate</em>. Oakland, CA: Independent Institute.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-indent:-24.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\">Levy, David L., and Peter J. Newell, eds., 2005, <em>The Business of Global Environmental Governance</em>. Cambridge, MA: The MIT Press.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-indent:-24.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\">Paskal, Cleo, 2010, <em>Global Warring: How Environmental, Economic, and Political Crises Will Redraw the World Map</em>. Toronto: Key Porter Books.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-indent:-24.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\">Rotberg, Robert I., ed., 2004, <em>When State Fail: Causes and Consequences</em>. New Jersey, NJ: Princeton University Press.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:32px; text-indent:-24.0pt\"><span style=\"layout-grid-mode:char\">Stiglitz, Joseph E.著，2002，《全球化的許諾與失落》。台北：大塊文化。</span></p>\n\n<div>張亞中、左正東主編，2011，《國際關係總論》。台北：揚智文化。</div>\n",
    "tpc_book_en": null
  },
